# preclassify-rename-row's starts of core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/preclassify.sh (BL-879 grammar). Every other
# drive is in process: run.sh sources the subject once and calls prec_main in a background subshell (pc_ip). One cli
# cell per distinct CLI outcome (exit 0 with the classified rows, exit 2 naming a forced git failure), each started as
# FXCELL=<id> bash "$PCS" in eqv() and compared byte for byte with the in-process call on the same input.
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/preclassify.sh cli-rows
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/preclassify.sh cli-refuse
